  "solution": {
    "text": "As per Molecular orbital theory,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>electrons</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> all paired electrons, so diamagnetic.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>24</mn></math> electrons and diamagnetic.​<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>electrons</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> all paired&nbsp;so, diamagnetic.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>CO</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>electrons</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> one unpaired electron&nbsp;so, paramagnetic.​<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NO</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#963;</mi><mo>*</mo></mover><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&